1321
00:59:32,300 --> 00:59:33,920
the different nodes densely connected,

1322
00:59:33,920 --> 00:59:36,460
and then you set some sort of parameter to be connected

1323
00:59:36,460 --> 00:59:39,380
to the certain nodes, or does it start where none of the nodes

1324
00:59:39,380 --> 00:59:40,130
are connected or--

1325
00:59:40,130 --> 00:59:41,380
PHILLIP ISOLA: Great question.

1326
00:59:41,380 --> 00:59:43,100
