1329
00:59:48,600 --> 00:59:53,480
The vanilla answer for GNNs is the--

1330
00:59:53,480 --> 00:59:55,365
the data tells you the connectivity

1331
00:59:55,365 --> 00:59:56,740
that you're going to have to use.

1332
00:59:56,740 --> 00:59:58,400
Like, the molecule that you're going

1333
00:59:58,400 --> 01:00:00,520
to be making a prediction about-- it

1334
01:00:00,520 --> 01:00:02,960
has a particular graph structure, which

1335
01:00:02,960 --> 01:00:05,200
