01:00:13,260 --> 01:00:14,595
That's given to you.

1341
01:00:14,595 --> 01:00:16,220
So the graph structure is given to you,

1342
01:00:16,220 --> 01:00:18,060
and then you try to process that graph.

1343
01:00:18,060 --> 01:00:19,760
It's like that's the data.

1344
01:00:19,760 --> 01:00:24,800
Now, you're alluding to, could I somehow take nodes and learn

1345
