1350
01:00:31,845 --> 01:00:33,980
So for now, you're given the graph structure,

1351
01:00:33,980 --> 01:00:36,360
and that tells you how to send messages

1352
01:00:36,360 --> 01:00:41,220
to process information on that graph

1353
01:00:41,220 --> 01:00:43,820
So this tree structure is important.

1354
01:00:43,820 --> 01:00:45,580
Oh-- and additionally, we're going

1355
01:00:45,580 --> 01:00:49,420
