1357
01:00:50,120 --> 01:00:51,360
So we're sharing the weights.

1358
01:00:51,360 --> 01:00:53,990
All those gray boxes are the same function.

1359
01:00:53,990 --> 01:00:56,240
They could be different functions at different layers,

1360
01:00:56,240 --> 01:00:58,980
but in parallel, across all operations

1361
01:00:58,980 --> 01:01:01,420
of aggregation within one layer of the message-passing

1362
01:01:01,420 --> 01:01:05,020
