1365
01:01:11,340 --> 01:01:15,580
That means that if we add more nodes to the graph

1366
01:01:15,580 --> 01:01:17,660
after having trained-- so we're learning

1367
01:01:17,660 --> 01:01:19,200
the parameters of these gray boxes,

1368
01:01:19,200 --> 01:01:21,892
