1371
01:01:28,500 --> 01:01:31,888
on a graph that has a different shape because in order

1372
01:01:31,888 --> 01:01:33,680
to aggregate over a different set of nodes,

1373
01:01:33,680 --> 01:01:37,120
we just use the same function again on those new set of nodes.

1374
01:01:37,120 --> 01:01:39,443
Just like in ConvNets, I can train on a small image

1375
01:01:39,443 --> 01:01:41,360
