1385
01:02:02,960 --> 01:02:04,838
But functionally, they can process--

1386
01:02:04,838 --> 01:02:06,880
they can just repeat the same operation no matter

1387
01:02:06,880 --> 01:02:09,960
how big the graph becomes.

1388
01:02:09,960 --> 01:02:13,880
So we're going to get to the theory that

1389
01:02:13,880 --> 01:02:16,800
